/* Câu chép chính tả: khung phát (giây) trong audio từng part. Câu cũ căn tay 21/10/2026; câu thêm 25/10/2026 lấy theo mốc lời thoại (sync.js), mỗi câu đã được nghe lại và đối chiếu lời thoại. */
window.CAMDICT={"1":{"1":[{"s":95.82,"e":99.66,"t":"I've been meaning to ask you for some advice about restaurants."},{"s":100.05,"e":104.24,"t":"I need to book somewhere to celebrate my sister's 30th birthday."},{"s":104.37,"e":108.37,"t":"And I liked the sound of that place you went to for your mom's 50th."},{"s":109.35,"e":112.86,"t":"Yeah, I definitely recommend that for a special occasion."},{"s":113.13,"e":114.68,"t":"We had a great time there."},{"s":114.71,"e":116.55,"t":"Everyone really enjoyed it."},{"s":119.65,"e":124.57,"t":"It's on Grayson Street, only about a 2-minute walk from the station."},{"s":124.48,"e":125.94,"t":"Oh, that's good."},{"s":125.9,"e":132.13,"t":"I'd prefer not to have to drive anywhere, but I don't want to have to walk too far either."},{"s":132.14,"e":137.96,"t":"Yes, the location's perfect, but that's not necessarily why I'd recommend it."},{"s":138.09,"e":140.04,"t":"The food's amazing."},{"s":140.52,"e":145.62,"t":"If you like fish, it's probably the best restaurant in town for that."},{"s":146.05,"e":153.87,"t":"It's always really fresh, and there are lots of interesting dishes to choose from, but all the food is good there."},{"s":153.91,"e":156.02,"t":"Is it really expensive?"},{"s":156.52,"e":161.67,"t":"It's certainly not cheap, but for a special occasion, I think it's fine."},{"s":162.09,"e":168.81,"t":"It's got a great atmosphere, and before dinner, you can go up on the roof and have a drink."},{"s":169.24,"e":172.79,"t":"It's really nice up there, but you need to book."},{"s":173.16,"e":176.79,"t":"It's very popular as the views are spectacular."},{"s":178.65,"e":180.71,"t":"So, that's definitely possibility."},{"s":181.07,"e":184.07,"t":"Then is there anywhere else you can think of?"},{"s":184.64,"e":189.73,"t":"Um, if you want somewhere a bit less formal, then you could try Paloma."},{"s":191.16,"e":192.53,"t":"I haven't heard of it."},{"s":192.48,"e":193.87,"t":"No, it's quite new."},{"s":193.9,"e":198.72,"t":"It's only been open a few months, but it's got a great reputation already."},{"s":198.79,"e":203.18,"t":"It's in a really beautiful old building on Bow Street."},{"s":203.14,"e":206.1,"t":"Oh, I think I know where you mean."},{"s":206.4,"e":208.16,"t":"Right beside the cinema."},{"s":208.17,"e":209.51,"t":"Yes, that's it."},{"s":209.5,"e":213.87,"t":"I've only been there a couple of times, but I was really impressed."},{"s":214.46,"e":218.19,"t":"The chef used to work at Don Filipes, apparently."},{"s":218.41,"e":221.1,"t":"I was really sorry when that closed down."},{"s":221.18,"e":224.55,"t":"So, is all the food they serve Spanish, then?"},{"s":224.64,"e":231.07,"t":"Yeah, you can get lots of small dishes to share, which always works really well if you're in a group."},{"s":233.06,"e":238.02,"t":"Yeah, there's a lively atmosphere and the waiters are really friendly."},{"s":238.71,"e":243.72,"t":"The only thing is that you need to pay a £50 deposit to book a table."},{"s":243.8,"e":246.35,"t":"A lot of restaurants are doing that these days."},{"s":246.29,"e":251.71,"t":"I should have a look at the menu to check there's a good choice of vegetarian dishes."},{"s":251.87,"e":254.86,"t":"A couple of my friends have stopped eating meat."},{"s":256.14,"e":259.26,"t":"I'd say the selection of those would be quite limited."},{"s":309.1,"e":312.2,"t":"Have you been to the Audley?"},{"s":324.44,"e":327.95,"t":"I don't tend to pay much attention to that kind of thing."},{"s":330.73,"e":335.51,"t":"It's in that hotel near Baxter Bridge on the top floor."},{"s":335.61,"e":339.06,"t":"Oh, the views would be incredible from up there."},{"s":338.91,"e":340.83,"t":"Yeah, I'd love to go."},{"s":341.43,"e":350.55,"t":"I can't think of the chef's name, but she was a judge on that TV cookery show recently, and she's written a couple of cookery books."},{"s":350.61,"e":352.7,"t":"Oh, Angela Fra."},{"s":352.96,"e":354.08,"t":"That's the one."},{"s":354.45,"e":359.13,"t":"Anyway, it's had excellent reviews from all the newspapers."},{"s":359.18,"e":362.65,"t":"that would be a memorable place for a celebration."},{"s":364.45,"e":370.67,"t":"Obviously, it's worth going there just for the view, but the food is supposed to be really special."},{"s":370.86,"e":374.86,"t":"She only likes cooking with local products, doesn't she?"},{"s":375.96,"e":384.11,"t":"Everything at the restaurant has to be sourced within a short distance and absolutely nothing flown in from abroad."},{"s":384.12,"e":387.08,"t":"I imagine it's really expensive, though."},{"s":387.36,"e":390.12,"t":"Well, you could go for the set lunch."},{"s":390.36,"e":395.46,"t":"That's quite reasonable for a top class restaurant. £30 ahead."},{"s":395.97,"e":399.49,"t":"In the evening, I think it would be more like £50."},{"s":399.75,"e":402.28,"t":"At least that, I should think."},{"s":402.3,"e":405.1,"t":"But I'm sure everyone would enjoy it."},{"s":405.54,"e":409.38,"t":"It's not the kind of place you leave feeling hungry, though, is it?"},{"s":409.34,"e":411.27,"t":"With tiny portions?"},{"s":411.4,"e":414.22,"t":"No, the reviews I've read didn't mention that."},{"s":414.65,"e":416.83,"t":"I imagine they'd be average."}],"2":[{"s":15.55,"e":58.18,"t":"First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 16."},{"s":73.53,"e":75.73,"t":"Hello and welcome."},{"s":76.38,"e":83.25,"t":"My name's Heather McCallum and I'm one of the potters who work here at Adelman Pottery."},{"s":83.66,"e":89.28,"t":"Before we go into the workshop, I just want to say a bit about the craft of pottery."},{"s":89.36,"e":95.81,"t":"Then we'll have a look at the equipment and you can try making a pot of your own."},{"s":96.17,"e":104.64,"t":"Like many people, I'm sure you know that pottery as an art form is tens of thousands of years old."},{"s":104.95,"e":117.12,"t":"And we know this because it stands the test of time, Things like baskets and pictures don't survive in the earth in the same way that pots do."},{"s":117.17,"e":121.21,"t":"And even if ancient pots are found in in small pieces."},{"s":121.25,"e":125.71,"t":"They still provide a lot of information about the past."},{"s":126.18,"e":135.61,"t":"There's no doubt that pottery has given archaeologists a fascinating insight into how ancient humans lived."},{"s":136.13,"e":139.24,"t":"The shape of an artifact may have been lost."},{"s":139.43,"e":149.57,"t":"But archaeologists can tell whether the pots were for, say, storage or cooking by examining the impressions on the clay."},{"s":149.73,"e":158.27,"t":"The scratches from tools and the clay itself can reveal where the pots came from."},{"s":158.51,"e":166.63,"t":"When I ask people why they want to take a pottery class with me, they sometimes talk about these things."},{"s":166.82,"e":174.61,"t":"Like our ancestors, they hope that something they create will also last longer than they do."},{"s":174.75,"e":183.96,"t":"That their work, whether it is good or not, might say something about humanity many years after their death."},{"s":184.59,"e":188.96,"t":"Of course, you will all have your own reasons for coming here."},{"s":189.36,"e":196.75,"t":"As far as I'm concerned, what I love most is the concentration you need to make a good pot."},{"s":197.46,"e":202.32,"t":"That focus takes you away from the stresses of everyday life."},{"s":202.71,"e":209.88,"t":"If you're elderly, it's also good exercise for hands and wrists and helps with arthritis."},{"s":210.08,"e":215.8,"t":"And of course, it's a fun activity for children because it's so messy."},{"s":216.02,"e":225.17,"t":"Here at Adelman Pottery, we show you some of the basic pottery techniques so that you can use these to create whatever you wish."},{"s":225.11,"e":227.43,"t":"A gift for a friend perhaps."},{"s":227.65,"e":234.38,"t":"Like nearly everyone who comes here, I'm sure this is the first time you will have tried the art."},{"s":234.51,"e":237.03,"t":"So, we'll keep things simple today."},{"s":237.69,"e":240.71,"t":"Now, before we move on, on."},{"s":240.71,"e":243.73,"t":"Can I just say a word about what you're wearing?"},{"s":243.73,"e":252.91,"t":"As we said in our email, please remove any watches, necklaces, etc., and put them somewhere safe."},{"s":253.24,"e":257.62,"t":"If you have long hair, do tie it back now."},{"s":258.84,"e":266.66,"t":"We'll provide aprons later, but I trust your clothes are old, but comfortable, not your favorite t-shirt or jeans."},{"s":307.12,"e":308.34,"t":"Have a look around."},{"s":308.41,"e":310.58,"t":"There's a lot going on."},{"s":311.03,"e":323.21,"t":"To make pottery that will last, you need a potter's wheel, a kil, which is basically a very hot oven where you fire the pottery, and some tools."},{"s":327.26,"e":331.59,"t":"If you look over in the far corner, You'll see one of ours."},{"s":331.77,"e":335.94,"t":"Since their invention, kilns have changed very little."},{"s":336.03,"e":342.33,"t":"Though in the past 20 years, a lot of progress has been made in temperature control."},{"s":342.6,"e":350.28,"t":"Basically, a kil removes the water from clay at temperatures of around 1,000° C."},{"s":356.23,"e":365.45,"t":"It's a pretty ugly, heavy object. object that's hard to keep in a house or flat, so most people don't have one."},{"s":366.01,"e":379.96,"t":"You may think, \"Can't I use my oven?\" Well, that's possible, but domestic ovens don't really get hot enough, and eventually the clay will crack and fall apart."},{"s":380.17,"e":389.46,"t":"Some people fire pottery in a fire pit outside, but bear in mind that can be dangerous."},{"s":390.12,"e":397.56,"t":"You also need to know about safety procedures for kilns as they release toxic compounds into the air."},{"s":399.06,"e":402.66,"t":"Every potter needs a potter's wheel."},{"s":403.16,"e":412.95,"t":"This machine is used to shape the clay into an object with circular walls or sides such as a bowl."},{"s":413.31,"e":421.99,"t":"Its invention revolutionized the pottery industry, allowing multiple items to be produced in a day."},{"s":422.14,"e":430.02,"t":"Lastly, there are a number of different tools that potters use depending on what . they want to make."},{"s":430.41,"e":437.94,"t":"When you start, your hands can make all kinds of shapes and curves without relying on a sculpting tool."},{"s":438.08,"e":445.04,"t":"However, there are some basic tools that you will need to handle the clay on the wheel."},{"s":453.02,"e":460.1,"t":"Rather than go through them all now, I'll just name a few tools as we go along."},{"s":460.2,"e":465.83,"t":"We can provide these, and I wouldn't recommend spending money on them yet."}],"3":[{"s":63.77,"e":66.23,"t":"okay, Tamara, it's been a real eye opener."},{"s":66.25,"e":72.58,"t":"I had no idea that loneliness has been increasing steadily for the last 20 years."},{"s":73.58,"e":76.91,"t":"And it's the same all over the world."},{"s":77.04,"e":80.04,"t":"The downside of a modern lifestyle, I guess."},{"s":79.98,"e":84.83,"t":"Did you come to any conclusions about what the reasons for the increase are?"},{"s":85.0,"e":89.94,"t":"Well, I'd assumed it was mainly an issue for the elderly."},{"s":90.11,"e":95.06,"t":"But in fact, it's something which affects young people just as much."},{"s":95.55,"e":98.49,"t":"So nothing really to do with longer lifespans."},{"s":98.89,"e":102.25,"t":"Um, what about social media?"},{"s":102.39,"e":107.46,"t":"In my case, far from making me feel isolated, it actually does the opposite."},{"s":107.61,"e":110.75,"t":"It definitely does more good than harm."},{"s":110.92,"e":115.54,"t":"I'd say loneliness has a lot to do with the way cities are designed."},{"s":115.7,"e":120.75,"t":"People living in high-rise flats with not much opportunity to speak to their neighbor."},{"s":122.18,"e":130.04,"t":"Another possible reason is that people are having fewer children and don't live in large extended family groups."},{"s":130.16,"e":134.8,"t":"But in this country anyway, that all changed decades ago."},{"s":134.91,"e":138.12,"t":"And yet loneliness is a more recent problem."},{"s":138.29,"e":139.63,"t":"I suppose so."},{"s":139.86,"e":150.12,"t":"A more plausible explanation is that people are having to move around for work and often end up living miles away from their family and friends."},{"s":151.37,"e":161.04,"t":"Looking at the studies on health risks and loneliness, there are claims that loneliness has as much impact as smoking 15 cigarettes a day."},{"s":161.16,"e":164.56,"t":"or similar to the risks caused by obesity."},{"s":164.73,"e":169.29,"t":"But I'm not sure there's enough evidence for some of these claims."},{"s":169.75,"e":177.83,"t":"Well, what about that one in Finland which showed that loneliness increased the risk of cancer by about 10%."},{"s":178.04,"e":182.73,"t":"And those findings have been supported by other studies, too."},{"s":182.75,"e":184.88,"t":"You're right about that one."},{"s":185,"e":188.19,"t":"I was actually thinking of the studies on dementia."},{"s":188.55,"e":195.66,"t":"Some found no association between loneliness and dementia and others found the opposite."},{"s":195.78,"e":197.55,"t":"Not exactly reliable."},{"s":197.7,"e":205.6,"t":"Then there's been a lot of research on cardiovascular disease and whether loneliness contributes to that."},{"s":224.1,"e":227.31,"t":"unquestionably the data on that is sound."},{"s":227.37,"e":231.66,"t":"what did you think about the evolutionary theory of loneliness?"},{"s":231.76,"e":239.35,"t":"well I thought the idea that loneliness evolved because it motivated people to be with other people quite convincing."},{"s":239.75,"e":243.33,"t":"Survival often depended on group cooperation."},{"s":243.25,"e":255.03,"t":"But I don't think there's enough evidence to claim that there must be a group of neurons in our brains which influence social behavior by making us feel bad when we're alone."},{"s":255.15,"e":261.28,"t":"There are a few studies which support the theory, but not conclusively enough."},{"s":261.53,"e":263.72,"t":"More evidence is needed."},{"s":264.03,"e":270.44,"t":"And anyway, this theory is not really useful when it comes to solving the problem of loneliness today."},{"s":319.59,"e":324.42,"t":"Should we look at the relationship between loneliness and mental health now?"},{"s":325.36,"e":334.14,"t":"So loneliness and depression are clearly related. and that's been recognized by various governments around the world."},{"s":334.52,"e":339.62,"t":"But unlike depression, loneliness has no recognized clinical form."},{"s":339.8,"e":346.22,"t":"There's no available diagnosis or effective treatments, and that's not likely to change."},{"s":346.38,"e":348.52,"t":"I don't think so either."},{"s":348.68,"e":355.14,"t":"I was thinking we should start our presentation with an example from our own experience."},{"s":364.47,"e":367.23,"t":"Everyone will be able to relate to that."},{"s":367.36,"e":372.55,"t":"Although a lot of students were probably too embarrassed to admit to it."},{"s":372.56,"e":380.67,"t":"Yeah, we could discuss ways of dealing with loneliness as well, like just talking to strangers."},{"s":380.65,"e":390.47,"t":"Loads of studies have shown that interactions with shop assistants and bar staff make people feel more optimistic and rel Next."},{"s":390.58,"e":397.09,"t":"I don't know about that, but it must make people feel more connected with their community."},{"s":397.62,"e":403.81,"t":"Although, you need to be a certain kind of person to be able to just strike up a conversation."},{"s":405.48,"e":413.62,"t":"We should say something about solitude and how being alone and being lonely aren't the same thing."},{"s":413.8,"e":419.47,"t":"It's strange the way some people can't stand being by themselves while others love it."},{"s":419.91,"e":431.1,"t":"Yeah, the research shows a certain amount of solitude is beneficial for well-being, which I appreciate, but being alone isn't something I actually like."},{"s":431.19,"e":434.83,"t":"I'd never choose to go on holiday alone, for example."},{"s":436.29,"e":438.08,"t":"Well, let's not."}],"4":[{"s":75.87,"e":80.4,"t":"lt's quite hard to think of a city that doesn't have a big river running through it."},{"s":80.7,"e":88.27,"t":"If you think about the major cities in the world, Shanghai, New York, Mumbai, London, they're nearly all built on rivers."},{"s":88.87,"e":93.39,"t":"When these cities were established hundreds or even thousands of years ago."},{"s":93.53,"e":96.36,"t":"The rivers were a big part of people's lives."},{"s":96.66,"e":103.04,"t":"In 16th century London, the quickest way to get from one part of the city to another was by river."},{"s":116.93,"e":122.77,"t":"But as industries developed and popular ations increased, city rivers suffered."},{"s":122.94,"e":129.06,"t":"The rising number of people meant there was a huge increase in the amount of sewage discharged into the rivers."},{"s":129.29,"e":136.81,"t":"Rivers had always been used for this purpose, but when the number of inhabitants was so small, that wasn't such a problem."},{"s":137.4,"e":143.85,"t":"However, as cities grew to over a million inhabitants, the impact on the rivers became more serious."},{"s":144.34,"e":153.3,"t":"In addition, other types of pollution increased as factories were built beside the river. and discharge their waste materials into the water."},{"s":153.39,"e":155.73,"t":"This got worse over time."},{"s":156.17,"e":169.65,"t":"As recently as 1957, scientists at London's Natural History Museum declared that the river Temps was dead in biological terms, as the water was too filthy to support any kind of life."},{"s":170.57,"e":180.35,"t":"But in recent years, as rivers lost their industrial function, cities have begun to recognize their true value and to take steps to clean them up."},{"s":180.43,"e":185.61,"t":"For example, the river temps is now cleaner than it's been for 150 years."},{"s":186.03,"e":189.27,"t":"These days, you can see seals swimming in the water."},{"s":189.38,"e":196.69,"t":"And recently, people had to try to rescue a whale which had got lost and swam up the river from the sea by mistake."},{"s":197.21,"e":204.23,"t":"Unfortunately, they didn't succeed, but the problem was disorientation rather than the quality of the water."},{"s":204.66,"e":210.81,"t":"Then, all around the world, riverside areas are now seen as prime sites. for development."},{"s":211.23,"e":224.43,"t":"Warehouses that were once used for storing goods are now being converted into expensive restaurants and also into apartments with river views which are in great demand and sell for astronomical prices."},{"s":293.16,"e":303.17,"t":"To do this, we'll have to shift more traffic back to the river, but this time cleanly and silently making the most of modern technology."},{"s":303.76,"e":313.48,"t":"Already more than 2 billion passengers use the ferry to travel in cities around the world like Istanbul, San Francisco, and New York."},{"s":313.74,"e":316.17,"t":"And these numbers are set to rise further."},{"s":316.44,"e":322.06,"t":"Admittedly, it's not a fast way of traveling, but neither is a car when it's stuck in traffic."},{"s":322.92,"e":330.87,"t":"Of course, passenger traffic on roads might decrease as more people start working from home, but another Recent development."},{"s":330.87,"e":339.27,"t":"The huge rise in online shopping has meant that another form of urban traffic just keeps on growing and that's deliveries."},{"s":339.72,"e":344.58,"t":"Trucks and vans in the city pollute and double park while dropping off parcels."},{"s":345.16,"e":350.6,"t":"Imagine using I the immense capacity of shipping to take these trucks off the road."},{"s":351.04,"e":358.68,"t":"One freight barge can replace 44 large trucks, uses far less energy, and causes less pollution."},{"s":359.42,"e":361.65,"t":"When the barge docks at the riverside."},{"s":361.71,"e":368.45,"t":"The parcels could be taken the last few kilometers to their final destination on cargo bikes, electric ones."},{"s":368.76,"e":372.96,"t":"Of course, this is already happening in the Dutch city of Amsterdam."},{"s":373.02,"e":380.28,"t":"And in future, the final stage could even be carried out by drone, although at present this isn't allowed."}]},"2":{"1":[{"s":89.43,"e":92.54,"t":"I'm losing touch with my friends and colleagues."},{"s":92.59,"e":94.51,"t":"We really miss you in the office."},{"s":94.48,"e":100.33,"t":"We were all so sorry you had to leave, but you must be relieved to have more time to look after your mother."},{"s":100.33,"e":101.58,"t":"How is she?"},{"s":101.79,"e":105.71,"t":"Well, she's very cheerful, but she needs a lot of help."},{"s":105.69,"e":108.84,"t":"Have you tried to get any support from the local council?"},{"s":108.95,"e":111.3,"t":"No, I didn't know I could."},{"s":111.41,"e":114.89,"t":"Yes, they offer different kinds of practical support."},{"s":115.12,"e":124.49,"t":"They realize that carers sometimes need time for all the other responsibilities they have. apart from the person they're caring for and also that they sometimes need a break."},{"s":132.78,"e":135.93,"t":"Well, you'd have to have an assessment of your mother's needs."},{"s":135.9,"e":140.32,"t":"That means someone would come round and talk to you about the situation and what you need."},{"s":140.28,"e":145.75,"t":"So, for a start, they'd want to know the amount of time you spend looking after your mother every day."},{"s":146.32,"e":150.83,"t":"Then, they'll probably ask you what sorts of tasks you do for your mother. during the day."},{"s":151.14,"e":154.31,"t":"Things like if she needs help with getting dressed, for example,"},{"s":154.84,"e":156.84,"t":"I.e. help her with that."},{"s":156.82,"e":160.13,"t":"And also, I help her get into the shower in the morning."},{"s":159.96,"e":161.62,"t":"Yes, that sort of thing."},{"s":161.55,"e":168.91,"t":"They'll probably ask you if you do the shopping for her and help her at meal times and whether she can cope using money."},{"s":169.33,"e":172.23,"t":"Yes, that's becoming a bit of a problem."},{"s":234.71,"e":238.79,"t":"If I wasn't there, I think she'd forget to eat, for example."},{"s":239.15,"e":242.9,"t":"And often she doesn't seem quite sure what day it is."},{"s":242.89,"e":244.7,"t":"Yes, tell them about that."},{"s":244.73,"e":248.78,"t":"And are there any physical difficulties you have caring for her?"},{"s":248.82,"e":250.48,"t":"Lifting her, for example."},{"s":250.93,"e":256.29,"t":"Yes, she's quite heavy and I'm afraid of hurting my back."},{"s":256.39,"e":258.7,"t":"I'd be in real trouble if that happened."},{"s":258.98,"e":264.91,"t":"They can give you advice about that and also about how to avoid the possibility of your mom having a fall."},{"s":265.76,"e":272.58,"t":"So, once they've done this assessment, if I'm eligible, what happens next?"},{"s":272.91,"e":275.29,"t":"Well, they might support you financially."},{"s":275.37,"e":282.06,"t":"So, they might help you with transport costs, like if you have to get a taxi to take your mother for an appointment, for example."},{"s":282.07,"e":284.76,"t":"I usually drive her myself, actually."},{"s":284.84,"e":287.76,"t":"So, could I claim for the petrol?"},{"s":288.66,"e":290.84,"t":"And you can claim for the insurance, too."},{"s":291.91,"e":297.61,"t":"And if you need help with the housework, they can arrange for someone to come along once or twice a week."},{"s":297.58,"e":303.37,"t":"And one other thing, I hope You don't mind me saying this, but it's important you look after yourself."},{"s":303.72,"e":306.24,"t":"And it seems to me you're under quite a bit of stress. ."},{"s":307.69,"e":313.08,"t":"Well, tell the council because they may be able to give you some advice on how to minimize it."},{"s":313.33,"e":319.89,"t":"Really, though, actually, I feel so much better having talked to you."},{"s":319.91,"e":323.04,"t":"I'll get in touch with the council straight away."}],"2":[{"s":59.65,"e":66.02,"t":"Steve Wayne Wright from Elmley Town Council and I organize the town's volunteer scheme."},{"s":66.33,"e":69.82,"t":"I'm delighted you're all interested in joining the scheme."},{"s":70.13,"e":82.02,"t":"Our volunteers help to create a sense of community among the many people who live in our historic I - town of Elmley and make residents and visitors feel welcome at local events."},{"s":82.29,"e":87.98,"t":"Uh first I'll mention just a few of the activities that volunteers carry out."},{"s":88.35,"e":94.33,"t":"One is to walk around on the town center streets wearing our volunteer t-shirt."},{"s":94.44,"e":102.27,"t":"Tourists often ask how to get to a particular shop and they might also be grateful for recommendations about what to visit."},{"s":103.1,"e":113.96,"t":"The town holds a large number of concerts each year and part of the volunteers role is to get everyone in the audience to the right place as smoothly as possible."},{"s":114.4,"e":121.38,"t":"You'd be surprised how many people buy tickets then don't check them and head for the wrong section of the hall."},{"s":121.91,"e":129.63,"t":"Volunteers may get involved with community groups such as sports clubs or gardeners associations."},{"s":129.9,"e":134.4,"t":"Here the volunteers talk about how groups can help each other."},{"s":134.47,"e":146.26,"t":"For instance, a writing group might want to travel to another town to hear a talk by a well-known author, but may not know that another club has a coach they could travel in."},{"s":146.36,"e":153.38,"t":"The town produces a monthly magazine and Anyone who lives in the town can send in articles."},{"s":153.66,"e":157.89,"t":"It's free to residents and is paid for by local businesses."},{"s":158.04,"e":161.79,"t":"That's the responsibility of the council's advertising department."},{"s":162.86,"e":171.23,"t":"We depend on volunteers though to find out what people think of events they've attended and any suggestions they have for the future."},{"s":171.73,"e":184.07,"t":"The volunteers then send a summary to the editors, There are a number of clubs for retired people and Every year the council arranges lunch for all the members."},{"s":184.63,"e":196.38,"t":"The volunteers welcome the guests and when everyone's sitting down and relaxing after the meal, some volunteers put on a show, usually around half an hour of songs and short plays."},{"s":196.68,"e":201.63,"t":"The club members really welcome the chance to chat to the volunteers at these events."},{"s":202.68,"e":210.09,"t":"The town council has a _ 160 website, of course, and volunteers are asked to help by \"making sure residents know about it."},{"s":210.39,"e":217.95,"t":"It's updated every day with information about future activities and we want as many people as possible to use it."},{"s":269.76,"e":272.1,"t":"Go on to some practical matters."},{"s":272.27,"e":281.36,"t":"As you probably know, the town arranges three major festivals every year and they all depend on a large number of volunteers."},{"s":287.51,"e":297.29,"t":"More are needed for the music festival because that lasts a whole week. and even more help is required for the science festival even though it's only 2 days long."},{"s":297.7,"e":300.74,"t":"It involves quite a lot of venues though."},{"s":301.18,"e":308.77,"t":"It's a good idea to help at the festival you're most interested in because you can attend most of the events for free."},{"s":308.81,"e":320.14,"t":"We try to use volunteers who are flexible though because some festival events are held outdoors and the weather may affect the size of the audience and even whether the event can take place."},{"s":320.2,"e":323.49,"t":"So there can be changes at short notice."},{"s":323.57,"e":334.96,"t":"What's essential though is being able to get on well with other people and also to deal with someone who's behaving badly, as occasionally happens."},{"s":342.04,"e":347.46,"t":"So, we'll be timetabling you for duties the following week from the 9th onward."},{"s":347.75,"e":358.17,"t":"Later in the week beginning September 23rd, we have a chat with each of you to find out how you feel about being a volunteer and what extra support you need."},{"s":359.25,"e":361.05,"t":"As a thank Thank you to the volunteers."},{"s":361.05,"e":363.15,"t":"We arranged an annual event."},{"s":364.34,"e":371.44,"t":"In recent years, we've had a party in the town hall and last year a barbecue in Chamber Park."},{"s":377.04,"e":383.31,"t":"It's on Saturday, September the 28th, And if you'd like to attend, you can sign up once you start work."},{"s":383.84,"e":387.47,"t":"Now, this is the volunteers t-shirt."}],"3":[{"s":50.52,"e":54.5,"t":"Colin, I'm really struggling to think of a topic for our human geography assignment."},{"s":54.53,"e":64.44,"t":"Me too, Rosie, I'll tell you what, let's think about the different aspects of human geography and see if we can narrow the topic down a bit to help us decide."},{"s":65.06,"e":67.37,"t":"So, one aspect is population."},{"s":67.5,"e":71.07,"t":"That would be all about population density and migration and so on."},{"s":71.05,"e":73.27,"t":"Lots of facts and statistics."},{"s":80.47,"e":87.0,"t":"I'd never thought about the links between that and geography until Professor Lee gave us that lecture on cholera."},{"s":87.05,"e":94.33,"t":"How in the 19th century, a physician used street plans and plans of water supplies to find the source of a cholera epidemic."},{"s":94.56,"e":96.44,"t":"Yes, fascinating, wasn't it?"},{"s":96.66,"e":100.99,"t":"Or we could do something more general like economies."},{"s":100.99,"e":104.96,"t":"So how financial and commercial factors are linked to the physical environment."},{"s":113.22,"e":115.98,"t":"Maybe we could do something on culture."},{"s":115.84,"e":120,"t":"We had that lecture about culture and geography last week."},{"s":120,"e":121.65,"t":"I didn't get much out of that."},{"s":121.58,"e":126.03,"t":"It was also general and the lecturer didn't give any useful examples."},{"s":126.09,"e":128.11,"t":"Yeah, I hardly took any notes."},{"s":128.07,"e":129.85,"t":"It didn't seem worth it."},{"s":130.65,"e":132.44,"t":"We could focus on poverty."},{"s":132.59,"e":135.21,"t":"That's something that's a global problem."},{"s":136.09,"e":140.41,"t":"Lee was saying that you have to be careful with some of the figures relating to poverty."},{"s":221.36,"e":228.4,"t":"Yes, but where I come from, that's linked to another more serious issue, which is that a lot of people don't have jobs."},{"s":228.43,"e":230.06,"t":"That's getting worse and worse."},{"s":230.09,"e":235.72,"t":"And we also still have quite a lot of people who are homeless, though that's not quite so bad as it was."},{"s":235.61,"e":243.33,"t":"It would be nice to talk about some positive developments, like some of the new developments on the outskirts of cities."},{"s":243.17,"e":247.2,"t":"Yeah, they've opened some massive new shopping centers outside my city."},{"s":247.12,"e":248.73,"t":"Yeah, the same with mine."},{"s":248.69,"e":259.11,"t":"But it's meant a lot of the shops in the city center are closing down, but the outskirts are ideal for buildings that need a lot of space, like for conferences."},{"s":259.15,"e":261.04,"t":"They've opened a couple of big ones."},{"s":261.08,"e":262.76,"t":"Yes, we've got some, too."},{"s":270.42,"e":274.38,"t":"We could include something about developing disused industrial sites."},{"s":274.5,"e":279.03,"t":"It seems like a good idea because you're not doing any harm to the natural environment."},{"s":278.98,"e":282.9,"t":"Yeah, but aren't the buildings architecturally significant?"},{"s":284.28,"e":291.72,"t":"And what people forget is that they often used quite dangerous materials, chemicals and things which haven't been properly cleared away."},{"s":291.73,"e":294.48,"t":"So, the whole site has to be made safe."},{"s":294.49,"e":296.31,"t":"That can't be cheap."},{"s":296.19,"e":298.48,"t":"And I bet it's often not budgeted for."},{"s":299.45,"e":302.74,"t":"Have you read about Masdar City in Abu Dhabi?"},{"s":303.32,"e":306.17,"t":"It was designed to be a green city, wasn't it?"},{"s":306.14,"e":311.57,"t":"That might be a good example of a city which set out to depend entirely on renewable energy."},{"s":311.73,"e":314.52,"t":"Yes, we should say something about that."},{"s":320.74,"e":326.35,"t":"And they had big plans for recycling to reduce waste to the lowest possible level."},{"s":332.82,"e":338.81,"t":"It set out to conform to the usual principles, sustainability and so on."},{"s":338.97,"e":341.85,"t":"A lot of people were against it at first."},{"s":341.78,"e":344.1,"t":"They said the plans were unrealistic."},{"s":344.34,"e":347.28,"t":"I'm not sure how far they've got with it."},{"s":348.81,"e":353.53,"t":"So, it looks as if we have a sort of plan and we can work."}],"4":[{"s":92.05,"e":105.93,"t":"Interest in food fashions has risen rapidly since the birth of the smartphone when people first began taking photos of their food and instantly sharing them with their friends."},{"s":106.35,"e":116.49,"t":"The food industry in the UK in particular is obsessed with finding and exploiting the next big food trend."},{"s":117.08,"e":126.24,"t":"Marketeers aim to create a huge demand for a food item which was previously unknown or not needed."},{"s":126.64,"e":139.03,"t":"One of the most effective ways of promoting a new food product is by using social media influencers as brand ambassadors in return for free samples."},{"s":139.26,"e":143.3,"t":"Many influencers will post content about a product."},{"s":143.43,"e":151.87,"t":"Although there are influencers with hundreds of thousands of followers who can command large fees for their services."},{"s":152.04,"e":160.32,"t":"Companies which sell vegan produce were pioneers in being able to increase sales really quickly in this way."},{"s":161.89,"e":167.23,"t":"For a food item to become really popular, it has to be readily available."},{"s":167.53,"e":172.92,"t":"So supermarkets have a role to play in creating a new food trend."},{"s":173.44,"e":191.29,"t":"They have dedicated teams closely following which new products or ingredients are trending on social media and are particularly interested in what well-known chefs are putting on their menus."},{"s":193.01,"e":202.08,"t":"I'd like to look at a few examples of marketing campaigns which were really successful in launching a new fashion trend."},{"s":202.78,"e":213.4,"t":"Starting in the 1990s with the avocado, a British PR company was hired to raise its profile and stimulate demand."},{"s":213.69,"e":222.13,"t":"They paid for a group of journalists to travel out to South Africa to meet avocado farmers."},{"s":222.71,"e":235.61,"t":"Articles written following this visit helped to educate the British public about the avocado, which at this time was certainly not the daily staple it's since become."},{"s":236.21,"e":247.17,"t":"Advertisements were designed to promote the avocado as a superfood rich in nutrients and therefore beneficial for health."},{"s":247.79,"e":250.94,"t":"Avocados became hugely fashionable."},{"s":251.28,"e":269.53,"t":"And within a few years, UK avocado sales had grown from 13 million pounds annually to around 150 million, making it one of the most successful fresh produce campaigns in UK history."},{"s":269.99,"e":277.12,"t":"Oat milk is a recent example of a new product which became fashionable very quickly."},{"s":277.69,"e":286.9,"t":"Now there are many brands available but one company which had early success was the Swedish brand Oatley."},{"s":287.46,"e":297,"t":"They attracted a lot of attention with a media campaign which used provocation as a way of getting their message across effectively."},{"s":297.46,"e":301.57,"t":"The fact that this campaign aggravated competitors."},{"s":301.94,"e":310.08,"t":"Producing milk from dairy cows was seen as a plus as it helped to make oat milk seem cool."},{"s":311.26,"e":324.76,"t":"In the USA, the brand decided against a big retail launch in favor of getting the product into coffee chains, which removed the need for a big advertising budget."},{"s":324.95,"e":330.3,"t":"This proved far more effective than offering samples in supermarkets."},{"s":330.56,"e":338.26,"t":"Oat milk had an advantage over other alternative milk products such as almond milk."},{"s":338.54,"e":344.4,"t":"Many consumers prefer: it because it has less of an impact on the environment."},{"s":344.9,"e":356.24,"t":"It requires significantly less water to produce than other alternative milk products and it also has a relatively low carbon footprint."},{"s":356.64,"e":371.3,"t":"Norwegian skrei, a rarely available seasonal fish delicacy, otherwise known as Arctic cod, is now found on the menus of Michelin starred restaurants throughout Europe."},{"s":371.85,"e":381.3,"t":"The demand for skrei has been used by a food marketing agency to build the reputation of Norway's fisheries in general."},{"s":382.04,"e":391.06,"t":"Marketing surveys have shown that a significant number of shoppers now associate Norway with excellent seafood."},{"s":391.47,"e":401.43,"t":"Food trends can be considered a good thing in some ways as they can benefit farmers and food producers enormously."},{"s":402.25,"e":408.47,"t":"The public can also be encouraged to buy things which are more sustainably produced."},{"s":408.7,"e":416.08,"t":"But ethical concerns have been raised about the effects a surge in demand can cause."},{"s":416.26,"e":418.43,"t":"Quinoa is a classic example."},{"s":418.64,"e":421.43,"t":"This plant is native to Peru."},{"s":421.71,"e":429.54,"t":"And when demand peaked some years ago, the price soared, making it unaffordable for local people."},{"s":430.56,"e":438.36,"t":"While the popularity of quinoa has benefited farmers financially, there have been other negative consequences."},{"s":439.05,"e":446.33,"t":"As demand grew, farmers began working the land all year round in order to produce more quinoa."},{"s":446.5,"e":458.3,"t":"One issue has been that the fertility of the soil decreased dramatically which could potentially lead to desertification in some areas."},{"s":458.94,"e":462.39,"t":"Another example would be the case of..."}]},"3":{"1":[{"s":101.99,"e":104.16,"t":"Hi, this is Shelley Meyer."},{"s":104.2,"e":106.68,"t":"I'm renting your house on Archwood Avenue."},{"s":106.69,"e":109.28,"t":"I'm due to move in next week."},{"s":109.98,"e":110.95,"t":"Hello, Miss Meyer."},{"s":110.99,"e":112.92,"t":"What can I do for you?"},{"s":113.23,"e":117.95,"t":"When I viewed the house, I told you I'll most probably need to rent some furniture."},{"s":118.08,"e":123.15,"t":"At least until I know whether my temporary work contract is going to be made permanent. ,"},{"s":123.39,"e":124.61,"t":"Yes, of course."},{"s":125.3,"e":130.64,"t":"And I said I could give you some information about furniture rental companies in the city."},{"s":132.3,"e":135.69,"t":"Well, the biggest company is called Peak Rentals."},{"s":135.94,"e":140.36,"t":"I've recommended them to other people and I've always heard positive reports about them."},{"s":140.43,"e":143.58,"t":"Could you give me an idea of their costs?"},{"s":144.48,"e":147.33,"t":"I actually have one of their brochures here."},{"s":147.56,"e":154.81,"t":"It says the monthly price per room. starts at $105 and goes up to $239."},{"s":155.7,"e":159.57,"t":"That depends on which rooms you need furniture for, of course."},{"s":160.19,"e":164.49,"t":"It's just to get a general idea of how much it's going to cost."},{"s":164.96,"e":169.13,"t":"And you said you had some positive feedback about this company."},{"s":170.49,"e":176.59,"t":"People have mentioned that the furniture from Peak Rentals is more modern than any of the other companies."},{"s":177.09,"e":183.81,"t":"And also, once you place an order, the furniture will be delivered to you in just one or two days."},{"s":183.9,"e":185.94,"t":"That would be really helpful. ."},{"s":186.12,"e":190.9,"t":"Oh, and the brochure says that there's a special offer at the moment."},{"s":191.06,"e":197.32,"t":"If you rent living room furniture, I believe that's a set of chairs and a TV table."},{"s":197.4,"e":200.58,"t":"You'll also get a lamp at no extra cost."},{"s":201.13,"e":206.89,"t":"Okay, but you know that price range you gave is more than I was hoping to pay."},{"s":207.11,"e":210.03,"t":"Then you could try Aaron and Oliver."},{"s":218.48,"e":219.59,"t":"Are they cheaper?"},{"s":219.94,"e":229.54,"t":"I'd say they're a mid-price company, but if you chose them, you need to be aware that they charge an extra 12% every month in case of damage."},{"s":229.82,"e":231.6,"t":"Oh, I see."},{"s":231.69,"e":234.25,"t":"I'd have to do the math carefully then."},{"s":235.35,"e":239.66,"t":"But one helpful thing is that they also do cleaning for customers."},{"s":239.68,"e":240.97,"t":"For the furniture?"},{"s":241.22,"e":242.28,"t":"For the house."},{"s":242.4,"e":243.6,"t":"Oh, I see."},{"s":243.62,"e":245.51,"t":"I probably won't need that."},{"s":304.44,"e":308.43,"t":"That's for both furniture and also electronic equipment."},{"s":308.62,"e":310.47,"t":"Well, that would be good."},{"s":310.76,"e":317.34,"t":"I'm not bringing much with me, and I won't have much time to go shopping after I start my job."},{"s":317.73,"e":321.54,"t":"There are two things you need to know about large furniture."},{"s":322.04,"e":327.73,"t":"First of all, you have to take out insurance on the furniture, and you need to organize that yourself. ."},{"s":327.79,"e":329.43,"t":"That wouldn't be too hard."},{"s":330.04,"e":337.29,"t":"Also, you can't take out a contract for less than 6 months, but I figure that might not be a problem for you."},{"s":337.6,"e":341.0,"t":"You're renting the house for 12 months after all, aren't you?"},{"s":343.97,"e":345.57,"t":"Sorry to interrupt."},{"s":345.72,"e":348.4,"t":"I just thought of another furniture rental company."},{"s":348.47,"e":353.45,"t":"It's called Space Rentals, and it's located very near to the house."},{"s":354.74,"e":363.17,"t":"I don't have any information about their charges, so it's best to use their app to find out what it would cost you to use them."},{"s":364.08,"e":365.51,"t":"I'll do that."},{"s":366.01,"e":376.95,"t":"One good thing about that company is that if you don't like the furniture once it's delivered, you can request exchanges as long as you do that within a week of receiving it."},{"s":380.09,"e":381.86,"t":"Well, thanks very much."}],"2":[{"s":81.1,"e":86.03,"t":"I'm one of the archaeologists investigating the site here at Bidcaster."},{"s":86.22,"e":93.07,"t":"This is the third summer for this community project and most of the people digging here are volunteers."},{"s":93.31,"e":104.27,"t":"I'm a full-time archaeologist for the town council, but I was asked to join the project by NHA, a charity which sets up projects like this up and down the country."},{"s":105.0,"e":112.04,"t":"As you can see, we're next to Bidcaster Castle, which is great because the owners let us use their facilities."},{"s":112.95,"e":116.04,"t":"So, how did we get to where we are today?"},{"s":116.79,"e":121.56,"t":"Many archaeology projects happen when an ancient object is found."},{"s":121.77,"e":125.28,"t":"And in our case, that object was a gold coin."},{"s":126,"e":131.97,"t":"Coins are often found by people using metal detectors to look for things buried in the ground."},{"s":132.16,"e":138.38,"t":"Or coins are uncovered when wild animals like rabbits have been digging tunnels."},{"s":138.56,"e":146.59,"t":"Here, a walker found it on the ground after a rainstorm washed away some of the earth and sand."},{"s":146.92,"e":160.23,"t":"When the story of the gold coin hit the news, Peter Swift, an amateur historian, contacted me to say he believed there had been a village on this site centuries before the castle was built."},{"s":180.09,"e":189.2,"t":"Over the three summers the team has been here, we found the remains of several buildings and more broken pots than you can count."},{"s":189.94,"e":197.18,"t":"Normally, you'd expect to find brooches and other jewelry, but we're still waiting to uncover any such items."},{"s":197.54,"e":205.77,"t":"The people who once lived here were skilled at making tools from animal bones, as you'll see when you visit the exhibition."},{"s":206.91,"e":214.17,"t":"Besides the discovery of the village, we've also found evidence of human activity on the other side of the river."},{"s":214.3,"e":221.16,"t":"No other houses or huts so far, but we can see the borders of an ancient field system."},{"s":221.86,"e":229.4,"t":"At one point, we found a long wall and thought it was an ancient palace, but it turned out to be a modern wall."},{"s":229.93,"e":234.3,"t":"This summer's work will end soon, but we'll be back next summer."},{"s":235.03,"e":241.03,"t":"In the meantime, we're putting on a series of guided tours for school groups this autumn."},{"s":301.05,"e":306.6,"t":"When you enter the site, please make sure you keep to the paths at all times."},{"s":306.66,"e":312.73,"t":"There are a few other things um the highlights of the site if you like that I want to mention."},{"s":313.31,"e":314.96,"t":"Take a look at the map."},{"s":315.0,"e":318.48,"t":"Our present location is marked at the bottom."},{"s":319.59,"e":324.15,"t":"This year we've identified the foundations of an ancient bridge."},{"s":324.51,"e":331.35,"t":"And it's really exciting today because a team of divers are in the river searching for lost objects."},{"s":332.18,"e":336.0,"t":"To reach the bridge, take the main path ahead of you."},{"s":336.2,"e":341.25,"t":"Go straight on and keep going till the path bends to the left."},{"s":341.79,"e":345.38,"t":"You'll see a smaller track leading off to the right."},{"s":345.8,"e":350.26,"t":"Follow that to take you to the river where the divers are."},{"s":350.77,"e":353.68,"t":"You might be interested to see the rubbish pit."},{"s":353.87,"e":359.01,"t":"This is very near the castle walls in the northwest corner of the site."},{"s":359.72,"e":364.33,"t":"It actually dates to the time of the castle and not the ancient village."},{"s":364.9,"e":371.84,"t":"We found oyster shells and fishbones and we assumed they were thrown from the castle kitchen above."},{"s":373.42,"e":379.37,"t":"One area we excavated in the first summer uncovered the sight of a meeting hall."},{"s":379.44,"e":387.58,"t":"We knew it was an important building because it had two rows of post holes deep enough to support a large roof."},{"s":387.69,"e":394.73,"t":"It's the largest structure in a central area of the site next to the current excavation area."},{"s":395.05,"e":399.25,"t":"Last year, we discovered a fish pond in the ancient village."},{"s":399.78,"e":402.18,"t":"Normally, these were beside a river."},{"s":402.6,"e":408.35,"t":"The pond here is further away, but it's possible the river has moved slightly."},{"s":408.89,"e":418.73,"t":"Anyway, to get there, from here, you turn right at the first information board you come to and follow the path into the trees."},{"s":419.34,"e":423.15,"t":"Before you come out of the trees, you'll see it on your right."},{"s":423.75,"e":426.9,"t":"If you reach the river, you've gone too far."},{"s":427.64,"e":430.32,"t":"So, does anyone have..."}],"3":[{"s":78.95,"e":81.09,"t":"How's your research coming along?"},{"s":81.03,"e":89.07,"t":"Okay, Maya, I didn't know theater programs are called playbills in the USA till I started looking into the topic."},{"s":89.52,"e":95.01,"t":"Even though I struggled to find many useful websites, I'm glad we picked this subject."},{"s":95.31,"e":98.37,"t":"No one else on the course is doing the same as us."},{"s":98.5,"e":101.62,"t":"Although it is one of the research areas of the module convenor."},{"s":101.71,"e":105.1,"t":"That might actually put some people off, I suppose."},{"s":105.24,"e":112.06,"t":"So anyway, I hadn't realized there are actually companies specializing in creating theater programs."},{"s":112.19,"e":114.45,"t":"Yes, they're quite common nowadays."},{"s":114.69,"e":120.12,"t":"Contrary to what many people think, theaters don't hire people to do the programs."},{"s":129.93,"e":132.69,"t":"It must be easier for theaters to do it that way."},{"s":132.63,"e":137.99,"t":"Yes, I remember reading something about programs in early British theater."},{"s":138.18,"e":141.5,"t":"It said that the cast was always very important."},{"s":141.42,"e":148.24,"t":"Yeah, audiences were very familiar with leading actors and big names would draw huge crowds."},{"s":148.35,"e":155.18,"t":"But I hadn't realized that If the program named a famous actor, that's who the public expected to perform."},{"s":155.37,"e":160.92,"t":"And if that didn't happen, people accused the theater of breaking their agreement with the audience."},{"s":160.8,"e":166.03,"t":"They would demand refunds, and if they didn't get them, there were riots."},{"s":166.74,"e":169.28,"t":"That would never happen now."},{"s":169.82,"e":171.39,"t":"People are too polite."},{"s":175.59,"e":180.61,"t":"We should definitely include that information about early audiences in our project."},{"s":180.74,"e":186.86,"t":"I also think it's important to mention that lots of ordinary people at that time were illiterate."},{"s":187.02,"e":191.39,"t":"So theater programs were of limited value in advertising plays."},{"s":191.54,"e":200.85,"t":"When a company of actors arrived in a town, they'd parade around the streets in their costumes, beating drums and announcing their upcoming performances."},{"s":202.3,"e":204.75,"t":"I couldn't imagine that happening now either."},{"s":204.97,"e":211.43,"t":"There's also an interesting comparison to make between 18th and 19th century programs."},{"s":218.32,"e":226.73,"t":"And unlike programs from the 18th century, they always used color and there was a greater variety of designs."},{"s":247.55,"e":254.23,"t":"I reckon the most important thing is the dramatic change they underwent during World War Il."},{"s":254.29,"e":257.68,"t":"When the government imposed restrictions on the use of paper."},{"s":334.9,"e":336.91,"t":"I found a couple too, Maya."},{"s":337.02,"e":339.3,"t":"Let's go through and see what we think."},{"s":339.78,"e":344.94,"t":"Um, this is an old one for a play called Ruie Blass."},{"s":345.1,"e":349.69,"t":"Never heard of that, but the program looks very decorative."},{"s":349.74,"e":352.22,"t":"Good enough to put in a frame on the wall."},{"s":352.37,"e":354.48,"t":"The images are just beautiful."},{"s":354.63,"e":356.73,"t":"Finn, what did you find?"},{"s":376.8,"e":380.86,"t":"I've got a copy of a program that's now in a museum."},{"s":380.9,"e":390.57,"t":"It's for the tragedy of Jane Shaw, and it's said to be the earliest surviving document to have been printed on Australia's first printing press."},{"s":392.08,"e":396.37,"t":"Another program to talk about is for the Sailors Festival."},{"s":408.29,"e":412.57,"t":"Wish I'd known about it while I was doing my research."}],"4":[{"s":78.45,"e":80.85,"t":"But what does that mean exactly?"},{"s":81.18,"e":87.99,"t":"Well, it simply means designing products that span economic, social, and cultural barriers."},{"s":88.49,"e":101.43,"t":"It means making sure products are accessible so that as many different types of people as possible can use them without any type of adaptation having to be made to the original design."},{"s":101.6,"e":108.69,"t":"Inclusive design is often linked with universal design although they are not quite the same thing."},{"s":109.0,"e":121.62,"t":"Universal design aims to make products that work for everyone and that includes considering the needs of people who have cognitive difficulties which can present quite a challenge."},{"s":121.97,"e":127.49,"t":"Today, examples of successful inclusive design can be seen all around us."},{"s":127.99,"e":137.37,"t":"In workplaces, it is common to see desks which can be adjusted to suit people of different heights or for wheelchair users."},{"s":137.82,"e":145.86,"t":"This still isn't always the case, however, and is one reason why office workers often suffer from back or neck problems."},{"s":146.55,"e":154.03,"t":"You'll find another example in the public toilets of countless hotels, airports, and offices."},{"s":154.4,"e":160.31,"t":"Taps that you activate by sensor require no pressing or twisting movements."},{"s":160.44,"e":168.12,"t":"These are not only more hygienic, they're also easier for people with dexterity or mobility issues."},{"s":168.87,"e":177.75,"t":"The tech industry has been criticized in the past for focusing too much on young consumers, but this is changing."},{"s":178.25,"e":182.44,"t":"Many products are now designed with the elderly in mind."},{"s":201.65,"e":211.65,"t":"Motor skills also decline with age, and some people have difficulty doing everyday things like picking up a cup or opening a door."},{"s":211.86,"e":216.6,"t":"This can also affect their ability to use a mouse or keyboard."},{"s":216.95,"e":223.13,"t":"So, voice access is now a routine way of making commands."},{"s":224.5,"e":239.87,"t":"It's worth looking at the problems non-inclusive designs cause when not enough consideration is given to a range of users as it can have a serious impact on people's lives."},{"s":240.75,"e":248.58,"t":"Access is one obvious example because it has such a huge impact on disabled people's independence."},{"s":249.23,"e":261.08,"t":"Not being able to access public transport because buses or trains are not wheelchair friendly means many disabled people can't go out unless someone goes with them."},{"s":262.25,"e":264.25,"t":"Safety is another issue."},{"s":264.62,"e":272.24,"t":"Inexplicably, most cars are still crash tested using a dummy based on an average-sized male."},{"s":272.67,"e":283.77,"t":"This has safety implications for all women, particularly those who are pregnant, as the seat belts worn by the dummy are not adapted to accommodate them."},{"s":284.07,"e":292.23,"t":"Over the past 100 years, workplaces in the UK have on the whole become considerably safer."},{"s":292.6,"e":300.02,"t":"Employers are legally required to provide well- maintained personal protective equipment or PPE."},{"s":300.36,"e":306.23,"t":"Anything from goggles to full bodysuits to workers who need it free of charge."},{"s":306.49,"e":310.19,"t":"But most PPE is designed to fit men."},{"s":325.08,"e":332.76,"t":"The problem with this is that women can be tall and still have much smaller shoulders than the average man."},{"s":333.01,"e":341.58,"t":"Ill-fitting PPE such as high vise jackets, vests, and body armor can put women at risk."},{"s":341.81,"e":354.76,"t":"The report found that 95% of women said that their PPE often hampered their work and that this problem was worst in the emergency services, particularly the police."},{"s":354.99,"e":359.02,"t":"Another problem is related to comfort at work."},{"s":359.25,"e":369.74,"t":"A very common scenario in offices in summertime is to see women wrapped in blankets or wearing sweaters while the air conditioning is on high."},{"s":370.53,"e":373.97,"t":"Meanwhile, the men are in shorts and t-shirts."},{"s":374.08,"e":378.88,"t":"This is due to differences in metabolic rates for men and women."},{"s":379.29,"e":386.91,"t":"There is a standard setting for air conditioning to be at a temperature of 21° designed to suit men."},{"s":387.16,"e":393.13,"t":"And in most modern offices, it's not possible to turn the air conditioning up or down."},{"s":393.81,"e":402.18,"t":"This means that many offices which mainly employ women are wasting energy by having the air conditioning set too high."}]},"4":{"1":[{"s":103.0,"e":108.02,"t":"Sandra, I seem to remember you had some family visitors staying with you recently."},{"s":108.15,"e":109.31,"t":"Yeah, that's right."},{"s":109.44,"e":112.71,"t":"My brother and his family were here a couple of months ago."},{"s":113.84,"e":116.37,"t":"Well, I wanted to ask your advice."},{"s":116.34,"e":120.83,"t":"I've got my cousin and her family visiting next month. month."},{"s":120.72,"e":124.84,"t":"And as I don't have kids, I'd have no idea where to take them."},{"s":126.54,"e":129.57,"t":"Are they going to stay with you in your flat?"},{"s":129.91,"e":132.06,"t":"Thankfully, there wouldn't be room."},{"s":132.23,"e":135.24,"t":"My cousin wants me to recommend a hotel."},{"s":137.37,"e":141.66,"t":"Actually, I always recommend people stay at the King's Hotel."},{"s":141.77,"e":142.89,"t":"Where's that near?"},{"s":143.0,"e":147.71,"t":"It's about 5 minutes walk from Murray Station, so nice and central."},{"s":147.77,"e":149.7,"t":"It's actually on George Street."},{"s":150.18,"e":151.65,"t":"Oh, yes, I know."},{"s":151.74,"e":154.3,"t":"I think they're on quite a tight budget."},{"s":154.55,"e":157.59,"t":"So, how much roughly is it to stay there?"},{"s":157.64,"e":162.65,"t":"If you book a family room, it's about £125 per night."},{"s":162.97,"e":169.24,"t":"My brother paid for two double rooms in the end, and I think that was around £95 for each room."},{"s":169.35,"e":171.31,"t":"Oh, that's not too bad."},{"s":175.0,"e":178.13,"t":"So, I want to organize some trips while they're here."},{"s":178.68,"e":184.89,"t":"I was thinking of doing a bus tour of the city center as none of them have been here before."},{"s":184.82,"e":187.39,"t":"Those bus tours are quite expensive."},{"s":187.62,"e":189.9,"t":"I think it's better to do a walking tour."},{"s":189.86,"e":192.92,"t":"It gives you a much better feel for the city."},{"s":192.92,"e":195.03,"t":"There's one that starts from Colton Square."},{"s":195.04,"e":198.5,"t":"It takes a couple of hours and doesn't cost that much."},{"s":199.23,"e":200.57,"t":"I'll look that up."},{"s":201.3,"e":207.18,"t":"If the weather's nice, one thing you could do is visit the old fort, but you could get there by boat."},{"s":207.13,"e":208.94,"t":"The whole trip takes half a day."},{"s":208.89,"e":211.09,"t":"That's a really really good idea."},{"s":211.23,"e":212.97,"t":"I'd like to do that myself."},{"s":213.18,"e":221.63,"t":"And if the weather's bad, I was thinking they could go to the science museum, but maybe they could do that when I'm at work."},{"s":221.58,"e":224.53,"t":"Yeah, don't forget it's closed on Mondays."},{"s":224.57,"e":230.18,"t":"They're here from Saturday for four nights, so Tuesday would be best, I think."},{"s":230.06,"e":232.38,"t":"And it won't be so crowded then."},{"s":234.1,"e":239.13,"t":"I took my kids to the exhibition on old computers there, and it was far too crowded."},{"s":239.13,"e":241.87,"t":"I wanted to go back, but it's finished now."},{"s":245.36,"e":249.6,"t":"There's another one starting soon on space, which looks really good, too."},{"s":250.17,"e":252.15,"t":"Well, I'll mention that to my cousin."},{"s":286.13,"e":290.89,"t":"Have you thought about where to take them to eat?"},{"s":291.2,"e":295.43,"t":"Well, I really like all the food stalls at Clton Market."},{"s":295.59,"e":297.88,"t":"My cousin's vegetarian."},{"s":297.86,"e":301.09,"t":"I know it's one of the best places. for that kind of food."},{"s":301.51,"e":304.76,"t":"And there'll be loads of choice for the kids, too."},{"s":304.99,"e":306.81,"t":"You need to get there quite early, though."},{"s":306.77,"e":311.15,"t":"At the weekend, most of the stores stop serving lunch at 2:30."},{"s":311.88,"e":314.57,"t":"It's all going to need careful planning."},{"s":314.85,"e":321.44,"t":"My cousin said she'd love to take the kids to a show at the theater, but tickets are so expensive."},{"s":328.69,"e":332.18,"t":"On some seats, there's a 75% discount."},{"s":332.98,"e":334.67,"t":"I must try and get some."},{"s":334.59,"e":338.06,"t":"Yeah, there are lots of things you can do for free as well."},{"s":337.99,"e":339.81,"t":"No need to spend a fortune. _ ."},{"s":340.8,"e":342.69,"t":"They're coming next month, right?"},{"s":342.73,"e":348.98,"t":"Well, check and see if it's the same weekend as the Roots Music Festival in Blakewell Gardens."},{"s":359.08,"e":362.17,"t":"And if you're In Blakewell Gardens, climb Telegraph Hill."},{"s":362.2,"e":365.67,"t":"You'll be able to look right down on the port."},{"s":366.02,"e":368.78,"t":"Everyone's always really impressed because it's so huge."},{"s":369.31,"e":371.79,"t":"I've been meaning to do that for ages."},{"s":371.87,"e":374.32,"t":"I've heard the views are amazing."},{"s":374.25,"e":376.29,"t":"Yeah, it's really worth the effort."},{"s":377.06,"e":379.53,"t":"Well, that's given me loads of ideas."}],"2":[{"s":59.79,"e":72.21,"t":"I'd like to give you some useful information about your visit to the stadium today and then we'll start the tour of the areas of the stadium that are open to visitors."},{"s":72.3,"e":74.64,"t":"I can see lots of children here today."},{"s":85.2,"e":90.27,"t":"Please don't let your children wander off on their own, even for a minute."},{"s":90.47,"e":94.21,"t":"We don't want any accidents or anyone getting frightened."},{"s":94.45,"e":102.21,"t":"Cameras are permitted everywhere and you can take pictures of your child shooting a penalty."},{"s":102.44,"e":108.63,"t":"Assistants are helping to organize this and hopefully the queue won't be too long."},{"s":108.72,"e":112.08,"t":"It's very hot and sunny out on the pitch today."},{"s":112.59,"e":120.3,"t":"You can get food and drink at the cafe and I really recommend the healthy lunch boxes for children."},{"s":121.05,"e":127.36,"t":"Also in the cafe, children are invited to do a football themed drawing."},{"s":127.56,"e":131.26,"t":"We'll pick the best one at the end of the afternoon."},{"s":131.43,"e":136.86,"t":"So don't forget to put your name and contact details on the back."},{"s":137.33,"e":142.43,"t":"That way, if you've left the stadium before, then we'll send your prize."},{"s":142.48,"e":146.22,"t":"But sadly, we can't return drawings."},{"s":146.68,"e":150.29,"t":"I'd like to mention some features of the tour."},{"s":150.41,"e":161.55,"t":"We'll start with the 360 cinema experience, which has been very popular over the years, and then I'll take you to the players dressing rooms."},{"s":181.26,"e":186.93,"t":"We've only just introduced this feature and would appreciate your feedback."},{"s":187.22,"e":191.7,"t":"We're thinking of offering tours in other languages in future."},{"s":191.74,"e":196.65,"t":"So, if you have any thoughts on that, we'd welcome those, too."},{"s":196.84,"e":203.91,"t":"If you plan to return another time, you might like to book one of our VIP tours."},{"s":204.15,"e":209.81,"t":"We've only just started offering these and they can be booked online."},{"s":269.9,"e":277.74,"t":"While that project was going on, the team had to play its matches at the ground of another club."},{"s":277.88,"e":282.83,"t":"Apart from that, the club has been here on this site since 1870."},{"s":282.93,"e":292.92,"t":"As some of you may know, that was the start of a really important decade in the history of football in this country."},{"s":293.55,"e":303.9,"t":"For example, 1870 was also the year that football teams started to include a player whose role it was to guard the goal."},{"s":304.38,"e":311.01,"t":"It's hard to imagine what the game must have been like without someone in that position, isn't it?"},{"s":312.28,"e":319.97,"t":"In 1872 and 73, many other clubs were established both here and abroad."},{"s":320.15,"e":329.52,"t":"And the following year, in 1874, referees were allowed to send players off if they committed certain offenses."},{"s":329.8,"e":336.49,"t":"And also in that year, teams started having to swap ends at Halime."},{"s":397.2,"e":403.35,"t":"By 1878, the number of teams in the football league increased again."},{"s":403.81,"e":411.94,"t":"In addition, referees started using whistles and electric lamps were installed on certain pitches."},{"s":412.35,"e":419.58,"t":"This was a significant change as games could then be played in the evenings all year round."},{"s":420.84,"e":431.55,"t":"In 1880, clubs began to charge fans for admission to games, even though players were still amateurs and had other proper jobs."}],"3":[{"s":3.05,"e":11.63,"t":"Narrator/Instructor: Part three, you will hear two education students discussing an assignment on teaching handwriting to children."},{"s":12.18,"e":37.98,"t":"First, you have some time to look at questions 21 to 24."},{"s":50.38,"e":53.35,"t":"How are you getting on with the assignment on handwriting?"},{"s":54.85,"e":61.59,"t":"You know, I hadn't realized that children benefit in so many ways from learning to write."},{"s":61.87,"e":72.33,"t":"It's such an important skill and yet most people think handwriting is less important than in the past because people hardly ever write by hand these days."},{"s":73.05,"e":78.78,"t":"And all the evidence suggests children should learn to write by hand before they learn to type."},{"s":78.76,"e":81.35,"t":"Not least because it helps their memory."},{"s":82.23,"e":86.62,"t":"The physical act of writing helps children to remember letters."},{"s":86.89,"e":89.98,"t":"That seems pretty obvious when you think about it."},{"s":90.25,"e":94.5,"t":"What's less obvious is how it helps develop their concentration."},{"s":94.65,"e":97.68,"t":"They have to sit still and focus on one thing."},{"s":97.89,"e":102.11,"t":"Yeah, that aspect of handwriting had never occurred to me before."},{"s":103.06,"e":108.4,"t":"I'm not sure I understand how it improves children's imagination though."},{"s":108.5,"e":117.62,"t":"Well, there was that study which showed that primary age children generated more ideas when they were writing by hand than using a keyboard."},{"s":117.64,"e":120.43,"t":"I would have guessed that would be the case."},{"s":121.11,"e":126.29,"t":"Yeah, I'd never associated spatial awareness with handwriting either."},{"s":126.75,"e":133.29,"t":"I thought spatial awareness was more to do with knowing where you are in relation to objects or other people."},{"s":133.54,"e":135.18,"t":"I thought that too."},{"s":135.33,"e":141.65,"t":"But good spatial awareness is essential for writing because you have to space words correctly."},{"s":141.8,"e":148.15,"t":"It's not just fine motor skills that improve through writing as I'd always assumed."},{"s":148.31,"e":154.41,"t":"Handwriting is so much harder for children with dyspraxia who have problems coordinating movement."},{"s":154.68,"e":158.55,"t":"It's good there are lots of things you can do in the classroom to help them."},{"s":158.71,"e":161.9,"t":"They need so much more support with letter formation."},{"s":162.03,"e":167.93,"t":"You need to play lots of games to help them distinguish letter shapes. lt takes a lot of patience."},{"s":168.32,"e":174.43,"t":"Yeah, I like the idea of using one of those pens that lights up if you press too hard."},{"s":174.44,"e":176.64,"t":"That seems like a really simple solution."},{"s":178.39,"e":191.96,"t":"I'm not sure there's much you can do about children with dyspraxia writing very slowly; it's more important to focus on accuracy and as they get more confident I think they eventually speed up."},{"s":192.03,"e":202.39,"t":"One quite simple thing you can do is to use grid paper so they write each letter in a box and that trains them to space the letters correctly."},{"s":202.31,"e":207.81,"t":"Indeed, that's more important for legibility than trying to get them to write in a straight line."},{"s":275.7,"e":284.22,"t":"For some children, it might be better to teach them to write on a laptop rather than by hand, like children with dyslexia."},{"s":284.43,"e":288.66,"t":"They often really struggle with handwriting, and some just give up."},{"s":288.62,"e":293.12,"t":"Yeah, it's not as frustrating for them if they get things wrong."},{"s":293.36,"e":296.66,"t":"On a keyboard, they can be more willing to have a go."},{"s":296.98,"e":300.84,"t":"But I read that developing fluency isn't any faster."},{"s":302.26,"e":309.9,"t":"Did you read that article on the benefits of teaching print rather than cursive handwriting where the letters are joined up?"},{"s":310.94,"e":318.46,"t":"Well, in the past, cursive writing was certainly considered more stylish and educated, but not anymore."},{"s":318.66,"e":331.27,"t":"Teachers' attitudes have changed because it's been proved that cursive is more difficult to learn, especially for children with learning difficulties who find joining up letters is really challenging."},{"s":332.58,"e":341.16,"t":"I was always worried that my poor handwriting affected my exam results, And now research shows that I was right to worry."},{"s":341.57,"e":348.09,"t":"I'm sure a lot of students think it's unfair that they're being judged on their handwriting, not just their knowledge."},{"s":348.12,"e":352.5,"t":"Marks are definitely affected if examiners can't read the script."},{"s":352.59,"e":356.83,"t":"That's why it's always been so important to teach children to write legibly."},{"s":356.9,"e":361.4,"t":"Do you think the role of handwriting will change in the future?"},{"s":361.63,"e":364.57,"t":"I can't see that changing much."},{"s":364.82,"e":376.76,"t":"Touch typing still isn't taught in most schools, which is a shame, but maybe that won't be necessary in the future because people will also be able to write by hand on digital devices."},{"s":378.27,"e":381.27,"t":"Anyway, teachers understand the value of handwriting."},{"s":381.28,"e":383.53,"t":"It's a basic life skill."},{"s":384.59,"e":391.9,"t":"However, the fact is that people are writing by hand less and less and relying on digital devices."},{"s":392.1,"e":393.92,"t":"That does cause some problems."},{"s":409.31,"e":411.92,"t":"I think you can put that down to lack of practice."},{"s":412.19,"e":413.62,"t":"I expect so."},{"s":413.89,"e":416.86,"t":"Personally, I miss writing by hand."},{"s":417.09,"e":419.19,"t":"I hardly ever write anything now."},{"s":419.54,"e":425.02,"t":"I remember my grandparents had such beautiful handwriting and it was so individual."},{"s":425.49,"e":429.57,"t":"Nobody I know would be able to identify my handwriting now."},{"s":429.61,"e":430.58,"t":"It's a shame."},{"s":431.34,"e":433.07,"t":"I feel the same way."},{"s":433.44,"e":438.35,"t":"I used to write a diary by hand and now I do that digitally."},{"s":438.43,"e":442.15,"t":"It just seems less effort to do it that way."},{"s":442.23,"e":444.47,"t":"So, it's not just a problem."}],"4":[{"s":89.85,"e":101.02,"t":"looking at different types of conflicts that may arise between wildlife and humans at the boundaries of protected areas such as national parks and animal sanctuaries."},{"s":117.66,"e":127.35,"t":"These include a number of birds of prey such as eagles, hawks, and owls that live by hunting and killing other birds and animals."},{"s":127.78,"e":141.15,"t":"Now, most of the people living in the local communities near to the bird sanctuary are small-scale farmers, and these birds of prey provide important social and ecological benefits to them."},{"s":155.91,"e":169.43,"t":"And the predatory habits of these birds also protect farmers in other ways, For example, a major danger to rural workers is snakes whose bite may be dangerous or even fatal."},{"s":169.48,"e":174.84,"t":"And birds of prey have a major role in keeping their populations under control."},{"s":174.94,"e":188.25,"t":"Local people have always been aware of these benefits and for years Even before the sanctuary was opened in 1973, the birds played a key role in the culture of the region."},{"s":207.02,"e":212.47,"t":"However, although these birds of prey are protected by the government."},{"s":212.68,"e":214.51,"t":"Their numbers are falling."},{"s":214.71,"e":216.96,"t":"Some of these deaths are accidental."},{"s":217.06,"e":224.87,"t":"Fatalities occur when birds are light on roads to catch and eat their prey and are hit by fast-moving traffic."},{"s":224.96,"e":233.22,"t":"Drivers in Zambia have to take special care at night as birds may regard the quieter roads as safe places to sleep."},{"s":233.95,"e":242.03,"t":"Accidental deaths may also occur if these birds fly close to high voltage power lines. as they may be electrocuted."},{"s":242.58,"e":250.5,"t":"This is a particular danger in the heavy rain which can occur in the region in the months from December to April."},{"s":250.63,"e":254.68,"t":"And local farmers also pose a threat to these birds."},{"s":255.33,"e":260.94,"t":"As well as growing crops, small-scale farmers in the area also rear chickens."},{"s":261.17,"e":267.35,"t":"These provide food for the farmers families as well as being an important source of income."},{"s":267.46,"e":271.82,"t":"But they're also an easy target for birds of prey."},{"s":271.83,"e":277.26,"t":"And so farmers may shoot these birds, which is illegal but understandable."},{"s":277.35,"e":287.35,"t":"Or they may poison the birds, which again is illegal and can have negative effects on the ecosystem."},{"s":289.12,"e":294.43,"t":"So how else can farmers protect their chickens from birds of prey?"},{"s":294.55,"e":300.34,"t":"Some people believe that to prevent the predators from settling near the area where the chickens kept."},{"s":300.69,"e":304.23,"t":"It's best to keep this area free from vegetation."},{"s":304.39,"e":313.42,"t":"But in fact, this is counterproductive as it means the chickens have no cover to hide in and they'll be easier for the birds to see."},{"s":314.19,"e":327.23,"t":"Another possibility would be to prevent the chickens from going outside at all and to keep them safe from predators inside a building, but this would cost far too much to be a practical solution."},{"s":328.37,"e":337.96,"t":"Nearly all the far Farmers reported that they spent a lot of time and effort trying to frighten off the birds of prey without actually harming them."},{"s":366.62,"e":369.53,"t":"None of these methods was 100% effective."},{"s":369.92,"e":380.41,"t":"So, as a result, the village people told us that rather than just using one method, they were forced to use a combination for them to have any effect."}]},"ext":"m4a"};
